---
description: ProVibe project constitution and trust boundaries
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` before implementation.

Preserve these invariants:
- canonical structured project state is primary; Markdown is rendered output;
- deterministic/provider evidence outranks reports and inference;
- unknown remains unknown;
- MVP provider access is read-only;
- customer repository code is never executed during normal analysis;
- secrets never enter prompts, logs, or client bundles;
- every verified material claim has evidence;
- Next.js web and analyzer-worker remain separate trust boundaries;
- prompts generated for users are valid JSON.
